5.4.3.2 Initiation
The network initiates the mobility from NR procedure to a UE in
RRC\_CONNECTED, possibly in response to a *MeasurementReport* or an
*MCGFailureInformation* message, by sending a *MobilityFromNRCommand*
message. The network applies the procedure as follows:

\- the procedure is initiated only when AS security has been activated,
and SRB2 with at least one DRB or multicast MRB are setup and not
suspended;

\- the procedure is not initiated if any DAPS bearer is configured;

