The IE *ReportConfigInterRAT* specifies criteria for triggering of an
inter-RAT measurement reporting event, or an L2 U2N relay measurement
reporting event. The inter-RAT measurement reporting events for E-UTRA
and UTRA-FDD are labelled B*N* with *N* equal to 1, 2 and so on. The
measurement reporting events for L2 U2N relay UE are labelled Y*N* with
*N* equal to 1, 2 and so on.

Event B1: Neighbour becomes better than absolute threshold;

Event B2: PCell becomes worse than absolute threshold1 AND Neighbour
becomes better than another absolute threshold2;

